{{!
    @template format_aicourse/hero

    The AI Course format hero banner for the course home page and for a section page.

    The banner is a named landmark region. It has two visual modes: gradient mode (no image) and
    image mode, which adds the aicourse-hero-has-image class and a dedicated background-image child
    so the CSS hover-zoom only scales the image. On the course home page it shows the course title,
    an optional stripped summary (image mode only), the section/activity/time meta row, the course
    progress ring and a decorative progress bar. On a section page it shows the section title,
    optional previous/next section chevrons and one numbered circle per visible activity in place
    of the bar. The whole progress block is omitted when completion tracking is disabled.

    Every line of literal markup is joined to the next with an empty Mustache comment, so the
    banner is emitted without any inter-tag whitespace: the numbered activity circles and the
    meta row spans are inline elements whose spacing is controlled entirely by styles.css.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-progress-ring-container - read by the ring animation to find data-percentage.
    * aicourse-progress-ring-fill - the arc animated to data-target-offset.
    * aicourse-progress-ring-text - the node whose digits are counted up to data-target.
    * aicourse-progress-bar-fill - the bar animated to data-percentage.
    * aicourse-ai-toggle - opens the AI assistant chatbox.
    * aicourse-ai-generate-banner - starts AI banner generation.
    * aicourse-ai-delete-banner - removes the uploaded custom banner.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    ACF-FIX-2.1.23: the title wrap, the summary and the meta row are now wrapped in a single
    .aicourse-hero-lede element. They were three siblings of the progress block, which is fine
    in a column layout but made them three competing items once the compact banner laid its
    content out as a ROW — the meta row collapsed into a narrow stacked column beside the title.
    Grouping them means the row has exactly three items: lede, progress, actions.

    * data-aicourse-hero - marks the banner so the format's JS can find it.
    * data-percentage - the progress percentage, on the ring container and on the bar fill.
    * data-courseid - the course id, on the ring container and on every AI button.
    * data-radius - the ring radius in viewBox units.
    * data-target-offset - the stroke-dashoffset the ring arc animates to.
    * data-target - the percentage the ring text counts up to.
    * data-sesskey - session key for the AI web service calls.
    * data-coursename, data-shortname - seed text for AI banner generation.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * accentstyle string PRE-VALIDATED CSS custom-property declarations for the course accent
      colour and hero fade, built by format_aicourse::get_accent_style(). Rendered with a TRIPLE
      mustache because it is generated CSS, not text: the builder matches the colour against a
      strict hex regex and clamps the fade to an integer 0-100, so nothing user-supplied reaches
      the attribute. Do not switch this to a double mustache -- escaping would corrupt it -- and
      do not feed it anything that has not been through that builder.
    * title string PRE-ESCAPED course full name (format_string) or section name (get_section_name).
      Rendered with a triple mustache inside the heading and re-escaped with a double mustache in
      the region's aria-label, which is exactly what the pre-template string builder did.
    * hasimage bool True when a custom banner or course overview image was found.
    * imageurl string Absolute image URL; escaped by the template into the inline background-image.
    ACF-FIX-2.1.26: the "Hero banner height" course setting is GONE, and with it heroheight and
    data-height. It only ever worked in gradient mode -- image mode overrode the floor with its
    own min-block-size, so the number a teacher typed did nothing on any course that had a banner
    image. The banner now sizes itself: a floor from styles.css, growing to fit a two-line title
    or two rows of activity circles.
    * issection bool True on a section page, false on the course home page.
    * hassummary bool True when the course summary should be shown under the title (image mode,
      course home page only).
    * summary string Plain-text course summary with all HTML tags stripped.
    * hasmeta bool True when the meta row has at least one entry.
    * metaparts array List of {text} plain-text meta items (section count, activity count, time).
    * hasprev bool True when a previous section chevron should be shown.
    * prevurl string PRE-ESCAPED moodle_url::out() of the previous section page.
    * prevname string Plain-text name of the previous section.
    * prevlabel string Direction-aware accessible name for the previous chevron.
    * hasnext bool, nexturl string (PRE-ESCAPED), nextname string, nextlabel string - as above.
    * progressenabled bool True when completion tracking is on; the whole progress block is
      omitted when it is false.
    * percentage int Completion percentage, 0-100.
    * iscomplete bool True when percentage is 100 or more.
    * radius int Ring radius in viewBox units.
    * strokewidth int Ring stroke width in viewBox units.
    * circumference string Ring circumference, pre-formatted as a string.
    * targetoffset string stroke-dashoffset the arc animates to, pre-formatted as a string.
    * progresslabel string Accessible name of the progressbar ("Course progress"/"Section progress").
    * progresstext string Long form percentage text used for aria-valuetext.
    * progressshort string Short form percentage text shown inside the ring.
    * countertext string "N of M activities completed", the text equivalent of the ring.
    * titlesize string Size tier for the title -- xl/lg/md/sm/xs, from its character count. The
      banner gives the title a fixed two-line zone and steps the type scale down instead of
      truncating, so a long name is shown in full at a smaller size.
    * circlesize string Size tier for the numbered activity circles -- xl/lg/md/sm/xs, from how
      many there are. Same principle: a fixed two-row zone, smaller circles as the count rises,
      so a section with many activities never overflows or scrolls.
    * hascircles bool True when the section has at least one numbered activity circle.
    * circles array List of {num, statusclass, islink, url, name, label} activity circles. url is
      the raw moodle_url::out() value and is escaped by the template.
    * courseid int Course id.
    * sesskey string Session key.
    * gradesurl string PRE-ESCAPED moodle_url::out() of the grade report for this user.
    * gradeslabel string Accessible name of the grades link.
    * showtutor bool True when the AI Tutor is enabled site-wide.
    * aiassistantlabel string Accessible name of the AI assistant toggle.
    * homeurl string PRE-ESCAPED moodle_url::out() of the course home page.
    * homelabel string Accessible name of the home link.
    * canedit bool True when the user holds moodle/course:update.
    * showremovebanner bool True when a custom banner exists and edit mode is on.
    * removebannerlabel string Accessible name of the remove banner button.
    * generatebannerlabel string Accessible name of the generate banner button.
    * coursename string Plain-text course full name, seeded into data-coursename.
    * shortname string Plain-text course short name, seeded into data-shortname.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Introduction to Machine Learning",
        "hasimage": true,
        "imageurl": "https://example.org/pluginfile.php/25/course/overviewfiles/banner.jpg",
        "issection": false,
        "hassummary": true,
        "summary": "A gentle introduction to supervised and unsupervised learning.",
        "hasmeta": true,
        "metaparts": [
            {"text": "5 sections"},
            {"text": "12 activities"},
            {"text": "3 h 20 min"}
        ],
        "hasprev": false,
        "prevurl": "",
        "prevname": "",
        "prevlabel": "",
        "hasnext": false,
        "nexturl": "",
        "nextname": "",
        "nextlabel": "",
        "progressenabled": true,
        "percentage": 42,
        "iscomplete": false,
        "radius": 90,
        "strokewidth": 12,
        "circumference": "565.48667764616",
        "targetoffset": "327.98227103477",
        "progresslabel": "Course progress",
        "progresstext": "42% complete",
        "progressshort": "42%",
        "countertext": "5 of 12 activities completed",
        "hascircles": false,
        "circles": [],
        "courseid": 2,
        "sesskey": "aBcDeFgHiJ",
        "gradesurl": "https://example.org/grade/report/user/index.php?id=2",
        "gradeslabel": "Grades",
        "showtutor": true,
        "aiassistantlabel": "AI assistant",
        "homeurl": "https://example.org/course/view.php?id=2",
        "homelabel": "Go to course home",
        "canedit": true,
        "showremovebanner": false,
        "removebannerlabel": "Remove banner image",
        "generatebannerlabel": "Generate banner image with AI",
        "coursename": "Introduction to Machine Learning",
        "shortname": "ML101"
    }
}}
<section class="aicourse-hero-sticky-wrap" data-aicourse-hero="1" aria-label="{{title}}" style="{{{accentstyle}}}">{{!
}}<div class="aicourse-hero-banner{{#hasimage}} aicourse-hero-has-image{{/hasimage}}">{{!
    }}{{#hasimage}}<div class="aicourse-hero-bg-img" style="background-image: url('{{imageurl}}');"></div>{{/hasimage}}{{!
    }}<div class="aicourse-hero-overlay"></div>{{!
    }}<div class="aicourse-hero-content">{{!
        }}<div class="aicourse-hero-lede">{{!
            }}<div class="aicourse-hero-title-wrap"><span class="aicourse-hero-title aicourse-title-{{titlesize}}">{{{title}}}</span></div>{{!
            }}{{#hassummary}}<p class="aicourse-hero-summary">{{summary}}</p>{{/hassummary}}{{!
            }}{{#hasmeta}}<p class="aicourse-hero-meta">{{#metaparts}}<span>{{text}}</span>{{/metaparts}}</p>{{/hasmeta}}{{!
        }}</div>{{!
        }}<div class="aicourse-hero-nav-progress">{{!
            }}{{#hasprev}}<a href="{{{prevurl}}}" class="aicourse-hero-nav aicourse-hero-nav-prev" aria-label="{{prevlabel}}" title="{{prevname}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline></svg></a>{{/hasprev}}{{!
            }}{{^hasprev}}<div class="aicourse-hero-nav-spacer"></div>{{/hasprev}}{{!
            }}{{#progressenabled}}<div class="aicourse-hero-progress">{{!
                }}<div class="aicourse-progress-ring-container{{#iscomplete}} completed{{/iscomplete}}" data-percentage="{{percentage}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}" data-radius="{{radius}}" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="{{percentage}}" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuetext="{{progresstext}}" aria-label="{{progresslabel}}">{{!
                    }}<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="aicourse-progress-ring" viewBox="0 0 200 200" style="transform: rotate(-90deg);">{{!
                        }}<circle class="aicourse-progress-ring-bg" cx="100" cy="100" r="{{radius}}" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.28)" stroke-width="{{strokewidth}}"/>{{!
                        }}<circle class="aicourse-progress-ring-fill" cx="100" cy="100" r="{{radius}}" fill="none" stroke="#357a32" stroke-width="{{strokewidth}}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="{{circumference}}" stroke-dashoffset="{{circumference}}" data-target-offset="{{targetoffset}}"/>{{!
                    }}</svg>{{!
                    }}{{#iscomplete}}<span class="aicourse-progress-ring-text aicourse-progress-complete" data-target="{{percentage}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg><span class="accesshide">{{progresstext}}</span></span>{{/iscomplete}}{{!
                    }}{{^iscomplete}}<span class="aicourse-progress-ring-text" data-target="{{percentage}}">{{progressshort}}</span>{{/iscomplete}}{{!
                    }}<span class="accesshide">{{countertext}}</span>{{!
                }}</div>{{!
                }}<div class="aicourse-progress-bar-container">{{!
                    }}{{#issection}}{{#hascircles}}<div class="aicourse-activity-number-circles aicourse-circles-{{circlesize}}">{{#circles}}{{#islink}}<a href="{{url}}" class="aicourse-activity-number {{statusclass}}" aria-label="{{label}}" title="{{name}}">{{num}}</a>{{/islink}}{{^islink}}<span class="aicourse-activity-number {{statusclass}}" role="img" aria-label="{{label}}" title="{{name}}">{{num}}</span>{{/islink}}{{/circles}}</div>{{/hascircles}}{{/issection}}{{!
                    }}{{^issection}}<div class="aicourse-progress-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="aicourse-progress-bar-fill" data-percentage="{{percentage}}" style="width: 0%;"></div></div>{{/issection}}{{!
                }}</div>{{!
            }}</div>{{/progressenabled}}{{!
            }}{{#hasnext}}<a href="{{{nexturl}}}" class="aicourse-hero-nav aicourse-hero-nav-next" aria-label="{{nextlabel}}" title="{{nextname}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg></a>{{/hasnext}}{{!
            }}{{^hasnext}}<div class="aicourse-hero-nav-spacer"></div>{{/hasnext}}{{!
        }}</div>{{!
        }}<div class="aicourse-hero-icons">{{!
            }}<a href="{{{gradesurl}}}" class="aicourse-hero-grades" aria-label="{{gradeslabel}}" title="{{gradeslabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/></svg></a>{{!
            }}{{#showtutor}}<button type="button" class="aicourse-hero-ai-btn aicourse-ai-toggle" aria-label="{{aiassistantlabel}}" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="aicourse-ai-chatbox" title="{{aiassistantlabel}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}" data-sesskey="{{sesskey}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .962 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .962L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.962 0z"/><path d="M20 3v4"/><path d="M22 5h-4"/><path d="M4 17v2"/><path d="M5 18H3"/></svg></button>{{/showtutor}}{{!
            }}<a href="{{{homeurl}}}" class="aicourse-hero-home" aria-label="{{homelabel}}" title="{{homelabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg></a>{{!
            }}{{#canedit}}{{#showremovebanner}}<button type="button" class="aicourse-hero-ai-btn aicourse-ai-delete-banner" aria-label="{{removebannerlabel}}" title="{{removebannerlabel}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}" data-sesskey="{{sesskey}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="3 6 5 6 21 6"/><path d="M19 6l-1 14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2L5 6"/><path d="M10 11v6"/><path d="M14 11v6"/><path d="M9 6V4h6v2"/></svg></button>{{/showremovebanner}}<button type="button" class="aicourse-hero-ai-btn aicourse-ai-generate-banner" aria-label="{{generatebannerlabel}}" title="{{generatebannerlabel}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}" data-coursename="{{coursename}}" data-shortname="{{shortname}}" data-sesskey="{{sesskey}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 4V2"/><path d="M15 16v-2"/><path d="M8 9h2"/><path d="M20 9h2"/><path d="M17.8 11.8 19 13"/><path d="M15 9h.01"/><path d="M17.8 6.2 19 5"/><path d="m3 21 9-9"/><path d="M12.2 6.2 11 5"/></svg></button>{{/canedit}}{{!
        }}</div>{{!
    }}</div>{{!
}}</div>{{!
}}</section>
